  ClassName: Samurai
  ClassNameEs: "Samur\xE1i"
  ClassIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 18cfa7668e0b1cd49b01cb5817a062a9, type: 3}
  Description: 'A monk with a katana: wide, long cuts that leave bleeding wounds,
    and Martial Arts stacks that also sharpen his blade. Whoever strikes his guard
    bleeds for it. Ultimate: Final Cut, a dash through a line of enemies that finishes
    anyone left below 5% health.'
  DescriptionEs: "Un monje con katana: cortes amplios y largos que abren heridas,
    y acumulaciones de Artes marciales que tambi\xE9n afilan su hoja. Quien golpea
    su guardia sangra por ello. Definitiva: Corte final, un tajo a trav\xE9s de una
    fila de enemigos que remata a quien quede por debajo del 5 % de vida."
